{"actor":{"type":"human"},"content":{"blocks":[{"content":"1\t# Text-Attributed Graph Sequence to Text-Attributed Graph Sequence (TAGSeq2TAGSeq)\n2\t\n3\tThis experiment explores training language models on graph-structured data. It implements custom data loading pipelines that traverse the text-attributed document graph to construct packed sequences.\n4\t\n5\t## Usage\n6\t\n7\t### Inspecting Data\n8\t\n9\tTo see how the graph traversal works and what the packed batches look like:\n10\t\n11\t```bash\n12\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/demo_traversal.py /path/to/pretokenized/dataset --strategy random_walk\n13\t```\n14\t\n15\t### Training\n16\t\n17\tTo run the training script:\n18\t\n19\t```bash\n20\t# Using default config\n21\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/main.py --dataset-dir data/pretokenized_datasets/simplewiki_full\n22\t\n23\t# With custom settings\n24\tpython experiments/dagseq2dagseq/main.py \\\n25\t  --dataset-dir data/pretokenized_datasets/simplewiki_full \\\n26\t  --strategy random_walk \\\n27\t  --max-seq-len 4096 \\\n28\t  --seed 42\n29\t```\n30\t","tool_use_id":"toolu_014wpQHw4SdaEHuv4oeKhMAK","type":"tool_result"}],"role":"user"},"context":{"branch":"main","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","head":"49da723e6046dbccfcf0e3966f6e68a44a5964dd","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/turnbridge.git"},"conversation":{"id":"claude-code:c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e","seq":806},"id":"ev1-3905573bb7325d02e5d4010a33aa68d722da876339d514223aa809ffb3525cc6","kind":"conversation_turn","occurred_at":"2026-07-19T17:14:06.546Z","producer":{"session_id":"c158a677-efd7-4ff4-87ac-1c3052566c2e","source":"claude-code","tool":"cledger","version":"0.2.0"},"raw":{"data":{"cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/turnbridge","entrypoint":"cli","gitBranch":"main","isSidechain":false,"message":{"content":[{"content":"1\t# Text-Attributed Graph Sequence to Text-Attributed Graph Sequence (TAGSeq2TAGSeq)\n2\t\n3\tThis experiment explores training languag